{"Title":"An Act relative to environmental science in public school curriculums ","BillNumber":"H504","DocketNumber":"HD2811","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SSH1","Name":"Steven S. Howitt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SSH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T16:32:06.627"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":null,"Name":"Connor Pozzi","Type":3,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T16:32:06.6266667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H504/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Howitt of Seekonk (by request), a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 504) of Connor Pozzi relative to environmental science in public school curriculums.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 1D of Chapter 69 is hereby amended by inserting after the word 'technology' in line 5, the following words:- 'including the major principles of environmental science.' \r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 1D is further amended by striking out, in lines 41-42, the words 'the major principles of environmental science and environmental protection.'\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}